   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.5,
    592.4,
    537.1,
    610.0
   ],
   "text": "the report notes that from 2000 to 2011, the Southern shrimp fleet operating throughout the Gulf",
   "conf": 0.9944,
   "retry": null
  },
  {
   "bbox": [
    70.5,
    606.0,
    528.7,
    623.9
   ],
   "text": "of America and along the Atlantic coast from Florida to North Carolina experienced eight fatal",
